<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-MacMahon wins A$25 million contract.</title>
<headline>RTRS-MacMahon wins A$25 million contract.</headline>
<dateline>ADELAIDE 1996-10-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mining contractor and civil engineering group MacMahon Holdings Ltd had won the A$25 million contract to build stage one of the A$120 million Southern Expressway, the South Australian government said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>State Transport Minister Diana Laidlaw said in a statement the contract had been awarded to MacMahon's fully owned subsidiary MacMahon Contractors Pty Ltd.</p>
<p>The contract is for construction of roadworks, bridges, and other major works on the 7.5 kilometres first stage of the 22 kilometre Adelaide suburban roadway, she said.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
